{"seq":1,"slug":"ios-core-data-cloudkit","title":"iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/ios-core-data-cloudkit","wordCount":1028,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ios-core-data-与-cloudkit-同步\">iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>iOS 平台提供两条离线同步路径：SwiftData + CloudKit（声明式，一行配置）和 Core Data + CKSyncEngine（精细控制，逐条记录）。核心概念包括：CloudKit 三类数据库（Private/Shared/Public）、Schema 的 additive-only 约束、字段级 LWW 冲突解决、VersionedSchema 迁移体系、iCloud 账户状态处理，以及 CKShare 协作同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-离线同步的双轨架构\">iOS 离线同步的双轨架构</h2><p>iOS 平台在 2026 年提供两条成熟的离线同步路径：<strong>SwiftData + CloudKit</strong>（声明式，适合新项目）和 <strong>Core Data + CKSyncEngine</strong>（精细控制，适合复杂同步需求）。两者底层都通过 CloudKit 实现设备间数据同步，但抽象层级和控制粒度显著不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;高层 API(iOS 19 推荐)&quot;&#10;        SD[SwiftData @Model]&#10;        MC[ModelConfiguration&lt;br/&gt;cloudKitDatabase: .private]&#10;        SD --&gt; MC&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;底层 API(精细控制)&quot;&#10;        CD[Core Data NSManagedObject]&#10;        SE[CKSyncEngine]&#10;        CD --&gt; SE&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;共享基础设施&quot;&#10;        CK[CloudKit Service]&#10;        ICloud[(iCloud Private DB)]&#10;    end&#10;    MC --&gt; CK&#10;    SE --&gt; CK&#10;    CK --&gt; ICloud\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph \"高层 API(iOS 19 推荐)\"\n        SD[SwiftData @Model]\n        MC[ModelConfiguration&lt;br/&gt;cloudKitDatabase: .private]\n        SD --&gt; MC\n    end\n    subgraph \"底层 API(精细控制)\"\n        CD[Core Data NSManagedObject]\n        SE[CKSyncEngine]\n        CD --&gt; SE\n    end\n    subgraph \"共享基础设施\"\n        CK[CloudKit Service]\n        ICloud[(iCloud Private DB)]\n    end\n    MC --&gt; CK\n    SE --&gt; CK\n    CK --&gt; ICloud</pre><p>选择依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>SwiftData + CloudKit</th>\n<th>Core Data + CKSyncEngine</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步粒度</td>\n<td>Store 级别（全部或不同步）</td>\n<td>Record 级别（逐条控制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 迁移</td>\n<td><code>VersionedSchema</code> 声明式</td>\n<td>Mapping Model 或 Lightweight Migration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突策略</td>\n<td>字段级 LWW（不可自定义）</td>\n<td>可自定义合并逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>极少（1-2 行配置）</td>\n<td>中等（需实现 delegate 方法）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>个人数据同步（笔记、设置）</td>\n<td>多用户协作、选择性同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"swiftdata-cloudkit-一行启用同步\">SwiftData + CloudKit：一行启用同步</h2><p>iOS 19 的 SwiftData 将 CloudKit 同步的配置极度简化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import SwiftData&#10;import CloudKit&#10;&#10;@Model&#10;final class Task {&#10;    @Attribute(.unique) var id: UUID&#10;    var title: String&#10;    var isCompleted: Bool&#10;    var updatedAt: Date&#10;    var priority: Int&#10;&#10;    init(title: String, priority: Int = 0) {&#10;        self.id = UUID()&#10;        self.title = title&#10;        self.isCompleted = false&#10;        self.updatedAt = .now&#10;        self.priority = priority&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 同步配置：一行代码&#10;let syncConfig = ModelConfiguration(&#10;    &quot;TaskStore&quot;,&#10;    schema: Schema([Task.self]),&#10;    cloudKitDatabase: .private(&quot;iCloud.com.example.TaskApp&quot;)&#10;)&#10;&#10;// 本地配置（不同步的数据）&#10;let localConfig = ModelConfiguration(&#10;    &quot;LocalCache&quot;,&#10;    schema: Schema([CacheEntry.self]),&#10;    cloudKitDatabase: .none&#10;)&#10;&#10;let container = try ModelContainer(&#10;    for: Task.self, CacheEntry.self,&#10;    configurations: syncConfig, localConfig&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SwiftData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CloudKit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Attribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(.unique) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id: UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> title: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isCompleted: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Bool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> updatedAt: Date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UUID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> title</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.isCompleted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.updatedAt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.priority </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 同步配置：一行代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> syncConfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ModelConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"TaskStore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([Task.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cloudKitDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iCloud.com.example.TaskApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 本地配置（不同步的数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> localConfig </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ModelConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"LocalCache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([CacheEntry.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cloudKitDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> container </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ModelContainer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Task.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, CacheEntry.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    configurations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: syncConfig, localConfig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CloudKit Schema 的限制条件必须在 Model 设计阶段就考虑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SwiftData 特性</th>\n<th>CloudKit 兼容性</th>\n<th>应对方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@Attribute(.unique)</code></td>\n<td>不支持（同步是最终一致的）</td>\n<td>用 UUID 做 PK，业务唯一性在应用层校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非可选关系</td>\n<td>不支持（处理顺序不确定）</td>\n<td>所有关系声明为 Optional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.deny</code> 删除规则</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>使用 <code>.nullify</code> 或 <code>.cascade</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enum</code> 存储</td>\n<td>需 RawRepresentable</td>\n<td>存为 String/Int 原始值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cksyncengine-精细控制的同步引擎\">CKSyncEngine：精细控制的同步引擎</h2><p>2023 年 Apple 引入 <code>CKSyncEngine</code>（iOS 17+），取代了手动管理 <code>CKFetchRecordZoneChangesOperation</code> / <code>CKModifyRecordsOperation</code> 的繁琐模式。它提供了状态机驱动的同步框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import CloudKit&#10;&#10;final class TaskSyncEngine {&#10;    private var syncEngine: CKSyncEngine!&#10;    private let database: CKDatabase&#10;    private let zoneID: CKRecordZone.ID&#10;&#10;    init() {&#10;        let container = CKContainer(identifier: &quot;iCloud.com.example.TaskApp&quot;)&#10;        self.database = container.privateCloudDatabase&#10;        self.zoneID = CKRecordZone.ID(zoneName: &quot;Tasks&quot;)&#10;&#10;        let config = CKSyncEngine.Configuration(&#10;            database: database,&#10;            stateSerialization: loadSyncState(),&#10;            delegate: self&#10;        )&#10;        self.syncEngine = CKSyncEngine(config)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func schedulePush(for recordIDs: [CKRecord.ID]) {&#10;        let pending = recordIDs.map {&#10;            CKSyncEngine.PendingRecordZoneChange.saveRecord($0)&#10;        }&#10;        syncEngine.state.add(pendingRecordZoneChanges: pending)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension TaskSyncEngine: CKSyncEngineDelegate {&#10;    func handleEvent(_ event: CKSyncEngine.Event, syncEngine: CKSyncEngine) {&#10;        switch event {&#10;        case .stateUpdate(let stateUpdate):&#10;            // 持久化同步状态（cursor 等）&#10;            saveSyncState(stateUpdate.stateSerialization)&#10;&#10;        case .fetchedRecordZoneChanges(let changes):&#10;            // 处理从 CloudKit 拉取的变更&#10;            for modification in changes.modifications {&#10;                applyRemoteChange(modification.record)&#10;            }&#10;            for deletion in changes.deletions {&#10;                applyRemoteDeletion(deletion.recordID)&#10;            }&#10;&#10;        case .sentRecordZoneChanges(let sentChanges):&#10;            // 推送结果回调&#10;            for saved in sentChanges.savedRecords {&#10;                markAsSynced(saved.recordID)&#10;            }&#10;            for failed in sentChanges.failedRecordSaves {&#10;                handlePushFailure(failed)&#10;            }&#10;&#10;        default: break&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func nextRecordZoneChangeBatch(&#10;        _ context: CKSyncEngine.SendChangesContext,&#10;        syncEngine: CKSyncEngine&#10;    ) -&gt; CKSyncEngine.RecordZoneChangeBatch? {&#10;        // 返回下一批待推送的变更&#10;        let pending = syncEngine.state.pendingRecordZoneChanges&#10;        guard !pending.isEmpty else { return nil }&#10;&#10;        return CKSyncEngine.RecordZoneChangeBatch(&#10;            pendingChanges: Array(pending.prefix(400))&#10;        ) { recordID in&#10;            // 将本地数据转换为 CKRecord&#10;            return self.buildCKRecord(for: recordID)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class