 self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buildCKRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: recordID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"schema-版本管理\">Schema 版本管理</h2><p>CloudKit Schema 一旦 promote 到 production 就<strong>只能做加法</strong>（additive-only）。这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可以新增字段（必须为 Optional）</li>\n<li>可以新增 Record Type</li>\n<li><strong>不可以</strong>删除字段、重命名字段、更改字段类型</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    V1[&quot;Schema V1&lt;br/&gt;title: String&lt;br/&gt;isCompleted: Bool&quot;]&#10;    V2[&quot;Schema V2&lt;br/&gt;title: String&lt;br/&gt;isCompleted: Bool&lt;br/&gt;priority: Int? (新增)&quot;]&#10;    V3[Schema V3&lt;br/&gt;title: String&lt;br/&gt;isCompleted: Bool&lt;br/&gt;priority: Int?&lt;br/&gt;tags: [String]? (新增)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    V1 --&gt;|&quot;安全迁移&quot;| V2&#10;    V2 --&gt;|&quot;安全迁移&quot;| V3\">flowchart LR\n    V1[\"Schema V1&lt;br/&gt;title: String&lt;br/&gt;isCompleted: Bool\"]\n    V2[\"Schema V2&lt;br/&gt;title: String&lt;br/&gt;isCompleted: Bool&lt;br/&gt;priority: Int? (新增)\"]\n    V3[Schema V3&lt;br/&gt;title: String&lt;br/&gt;isCompleted: Bool&lt;br/&gt;priority: Int?&lt;br/&gt;tags: [String]? (新增)\"]\n\n    V1 --&gt;|\"安全迁移\"| V2\n    V2 --&gt;|\"安全迁移\"| V3</pre><p>SwiftData 的 <code>VersionedSchema</code> + <code>SchemaMigrationPlan</code> 在客户端侧管理迁移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"enum TaskSchemaV1: VersionedSchema {&#10;    static var versionIdentifier = Schema.Version(1, 0, 0)&#10;    static var models: [any PersistentModel.Type] { [TaskV1.self] }&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum TaskSchemaV2: VersionedSchema {&#10;    static var versionIdentifier = Schema.Version(2, 0, 0)&#10;    static var models: [any PersistentModel.Type] { [Task.self] }  // 新增 priority&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum TaskMigrationPlan: SchemaMigrationPlan {&#10;    static var schemas: [any VersionedSchema.Type] {&#10;        [TaskSchemaV1.self, TaskSchemaV2.self]&#10;    }&#10;    static var stages: [MigrationStage] {&#10;        [migrateV1toV2]&#10;    }&#10;    static let migrateV1toV2 = MigrationStage.lightweight(&#10;        fromVersion: TaskSchemaV1.self,&#10;        toVersion: TaskSchemaV2.self&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskSchemaV1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VersionedSchema </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> versionIdentifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Schema.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> models: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PersistentModel.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] { [TaskV1.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskSchemaV2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VersionedSchema </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> versionIdentifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Schema.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> models: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PersistentModel.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] { [Task.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 新增 priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskMigrationPlan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SchemaMigrationPlan </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schemas: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VersionedSchema.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [TaskSchemaV1.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, TaskSchemaV2.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stages: [MigrationStage] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        [migrateV1toV2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> migrateV1toV2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MigrationStage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lightweight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        fromVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: TaskSchemaV1.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        toVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: TaskSchemaV2.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 <a href=\"../operations/data-migration-versioning\">数据迁移与版本管理</a> 中讨论的通用迁移策略一致，CloudKit 场景下的关键约束是：<strong>新旧版本客户端会在过渡期共存</strong>——V2 客户端写入的 <code>priority</code> 字段对 V1 客户端不可见，但不能导致 V1 客户端崩溃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"icloud-账户状态处理\">iCloud 账户状态处理</h2><p>CloudKit 同步完全依赖用户的 iCloud 账户状态。应用必须优雅处理各种账户场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账户状态</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>用户体验</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.available</code></td>\n<td>正常同步</td>\n<td>无感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.noAccount</code></td>\n<td>仅本地存储</td>\n<td>提示「登录 iCloud 可跨设备同步」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.restricted</code></td>\n<td>企业/家长控制</td>\n<td>隐藏同步相关 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.couldNotDetermine</code></td>\n<td>短暂网络问题</td>\n<td>延迟重试检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.temporarilyUnavailable</code></td>\n<td>iCloud 服务暂时不可用</td>\n<td>维持本地操作，后台重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func observeAccountStatus() {&#10;    Task {&#10;        for await _ in NotificationCenter.default.notifications(&#10;            named: .CKAccountChanged&#10;        ) {&#10;            let status = try? await CKContainer.default().accountStatus()&#10;            await MainActor.run {&#10;                updateSyncUI(for: status ?? .couldNotDetermine)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> observeAccountStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    Task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> _</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NotificationCenter.default.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">notifications</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            named</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .CKAccountChanged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CKContainer.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accountStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MainActor.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                updateSyncUI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .couldNotDetermine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ckshare-协作同步\">CKShare：协作同步</h2><p>CloudKit 支持通过 <code>CKShare</code> 在用户间共享数据，这是实现多用户协作的基础：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>共享数据存储在发起者的 Private Database 的自定义 Zone 中</li>\n<li>接收者通过 Shared Database 访问共享记录</li>\n<li>支持 <code>.readOnly</code> 和 <code>.readWrite</code> 两种权限级别</li>\n<li>共享链接通过 <code>UICloudSharingController</code> 管理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>协作场景下的冲突率显著高于单用户多设备场景。CloudKit 的默认 LWW 可能不够——此时需要在应用层实现 <a href=\"../sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies\">冲突解决策略</a> 中讨论的高级方案，或集成 CRDT 库处理协作编辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调试与可观测性\">调试与可观测性</h2><p>CloudKit 同步问题的调试工具链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CloudKit Console</strong>（dashboard.icloud.com）：查看记录、Zone、订阅状态</li>\n<li><strong>Xcode CloudKit Logging</strong>：<code>CLOUDKIT_DEBUG=1</code> 环境变量开启详细日志</li>\n<li><strong><code>com.apple.coredata.cloudkit.debug</code></strong>：UserDefaults 开关，打印 Core Data ↔ CloudKit 的映射细节</li>\n<li><strong>CKSyncEngine.state</strong>：运行时查询同步状态（pendingChanges、lastSyncTime）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>生产环境的同步健康度监控方案参见 <a href=\"../operations/sync-monitoring-debugging\">同步监控与调试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>iOS 的 CloudKit 同步生态在 2026 年已相当成熟：SwiftData 一行配置适合个人数据同步，CKSyncEngine 为需要精细控制的场景提供状态机驱动的框架。关键工程约束是 CloudKit Schema 的 additive-only 限制和 iCloud 账户状态的多变性。协作场景需在默认 LWW 之上叠加更丰富的冲突策略。Schema 迁移需在客户端侧和 CloudKit 侧同时规划。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步","id":"ios-core-data-与-cloudkit-同步"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 离线同步的双轨架构","id":"ios-离线同步的双轨架构"},{"level":2,"text":"SwiftData + CloudKit：一行启用同步","id":"swiftdata-cloudkit-一行启用同步"},{"level":2,"text":"CKSyncEngine：精细控制的同步引擎","id":"cksyncengine-精细控制的同步引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 版本管理","id":"schema-版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"iCloud 账户状态处理","id":"icloud-账户状态处理"},{"level":2,"text":"CKShare：协作同步","id":"ckshare-协作同步"},{"level":2,"text":"调试与可观测性","id":"调试与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CRDT 在移动端的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/crdt-mobile-applications"},"next":{"title":"Android Room 与 WorkManager","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/android-room-workmanager"}}